{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13210140","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13210140","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:3:1321014001:1":{"text":"サイレンシアさん、お怪我はありませんか！？","source_cn":"奇花！你没事吧？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x75255478A9E55A75","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1321014002:1":{"text":"だ、大丈夫です……すみません、ご心配をおかけして……","source_cn":"没、没事……对不起，让各位担心了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE10F56BA029D6FED","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1321014003:1":{"text":"無事なら良かったです……","source_cn":"没出事就好……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x269A3098C6026422","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1321014004:1":{"text":"ポットさん、ここまで追いかけてくるとき、誰よりも必死だったんですよ！","source_cn":"这么看来，茶壶先生还是很关心奇花的嘛！我们一路上追过来...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAEB009011C9AF8BD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1321014005:1":{"text":"そうそう！顔も真っ赤で、沸騰したお茶が吹き出さないか心配しちゃいましたよ！","source_cn":"是啊，茶壶先生跑得脸都红了，好像连脑袋里的茶都重新热起...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0B28ADE77B2FD31E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1321014006:1":{"text":"ポットさん、ありがとうございます……","source_cn":"谢谢您，茶壶先生……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x30BB3FFD2D754697","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1321014007:1":{"text":"いや、お礼なんて……むしろ私が謝るべきです。","source_cn":"唉，你谢我做什么……应该我向你道歉才对。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7BB5F78A48B34832","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1321014008:1":{"text":"申し訳ありません、さっきの言い方は間違っていました。茶葉の保管は私の義務であり、あなたには何の責任もありません。","source_cn":"对不起，刚才我不该那样训斥你。毕竟保存茶叶是我的职责，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x13EF4EA89998347B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1321014009:1":{"text":"違うんです、ポットさん……実際、僕のミスなんです。","source_cn":"不是的，茶壶先生……那不是你的错。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8CDADAA81A531AD6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1321014010:1":{"text":"つい先日の花びらと聞いて思い出しました。僕は蜜漬けするのを忘れていて……","source_cn":"我刚刚才想起来，前几天新摘的那些花瓣，还没来得及蜜渍……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x06C251F15E82B5C7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1321014011:1":{"text":"蜜漬け？","source_cn":"蜜渍？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD39E0ABF4476E894","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1321014012:1":{"text":"はい。茶葉として使うためには蜜漬けが必要なんです……花の香りを保ち、苦味を取り除くために。","source_cn":"是的。只有经过蜜渍的花瓣才能作为茶叶……既能保留花香，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB0F93AC8453FF840","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1321014013:1":{"text":"さ、さっきはそれを思い出して……すみません、すべて僕のせいです……","source_cn":"我、我刚刚才想起来……对不起，都是我的错……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x15140E2D09F1372D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1321014014:1":{"text":"なるほど！どうりでお茶が苦かったわけです！","source_cn":"原来是这样！难怪前两壶茶喝起来会是苦的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFA614AFA72C4CB87","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1321014015:1":{"text":"でも、これまでも花びらを茶葉として使用していたし、苦味もなかったですよね？","source_cn":"可是，我从没做过这样的事！为什么以前的花瓣茶叶没有苦味？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x28DAA3B2C5E25F06","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1321014016:1":{"text":"それは……毎回摘んできた花びらを蜜漬けにし、翌朝茶筒に移していたからです。","source_cn":"我……每次采回花瓣之后，都会将它们浸泡起来，第二天早上...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x617D28A1AC63B85F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1321014017:1":{"text":"ですが今回は、花びらを摘んで戻るとすぐに子爵様から仕事を任せられ……蜜漬けのことは、すっかり忘れてしまいました。","source_cn":"但是前几天，我刚回到庄园，子爵先生就说有一支颜料不见了...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB623C88404F59078","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1321014018:1":{"text":"……毎回、蜜漬けするのですか？","source_cn":"……你每次都会做这件事？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6FAFCC30B471F76B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1321014019:1":{"text":"はい。忘れたのはこの一回だけです！本当にすみませんでした……！","source_cn":"嗯，我只忘过这一次！抱歉，茶壶先生……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x96CC87E0EF4B6AB6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1321014020:1":{"text":"見えないところで黙々と仕事をこなしていたんですね。","source_cn":"看来奇花默默做了很多工作呢。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDCCE3BFB67999A86","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1321014021:1":{"text":"なるほど……子爵様があなたを選んだ理由が、やっと分かりました。","source_cn":"难怪……我终于理解子爵先生为什么会选中你了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE521DA65E98B400E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:30:1321014022:1":{"text":"それは……どういう意味ですか？","source_cn":"这句话……是什么意思？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x85445A323168AC27","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:31:1321014023:1":{"text":"つまり……オホンッ、子爵様にとって有用な存在だということです。","source_cn":"我的意思是——咳，你也不是完全没有可取之处。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6DC3915216DEC2C8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:32:1321014023":{"text":"つまり……オホンッ、子爵様にとって有用な存在だということです。","source_cn":"我的意思是——咳，你也不是完全没有可取之处。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6DC3915216DEC2C8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:33:1321014024:1":{"text":"……オホンッ！","source_cn":"……咳！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xF75CBC88F10829CD","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"……オホンッ！","female":"……オホンッ！","variant_male_record_index":"149051","variant_female_record_index":"149052","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:34:1321014026:1":{"text":"ここは危険です、早く戻りましょう。さて、今は何時かな……","source_cn":"庄园外并不安全，我们还是尽快返回吧。让我看看时间……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC5AEB9964691E1DB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:35:1321014027:1":{"text":"いけません、もうアフタヌーンティーの時間です。サイレンシアさん、今こそ自分の価値を証明する時です。","source_cn":"哎呀，已经到下午茶时间了。奇花，现在是你体现价值的时候了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6502F130984A2219","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:36:1321014028:1":{"text":"それは……アフタヌーンティーのセッティングを僕に任せてくれるということですか？","source_cn":"啊……我来准备茶点吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x927A69D9A3A9808D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:37:1321014029:1":{"text":"蜜漬けも忘れないでくださいね。","source_cn":"还要记得把苦涩的花瓣拿去蜜渍。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x19660808CEAF6561","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:38:1321014030:1":{"text":"はい……ありがとうございます、ポットさん！","source_cn":"好的……谢谢您，茶壶先生！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6A343A054868FF8D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:32:0:1":{"text":"自分が間違いだったと認めてるんだよ。","source_cn":"意思是他认识到了自己的错误","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xE722CC6024D96B8B","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_differs","male":"自分が間違いだったと認めてるんだよ。","female":"自分が間違いだったと認めてるのよ。","variant_male_record_index":"69596","variant_female_record_index":"69597","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:40:1321014025:1":{"text":"そうかもしれませんね。私は子爵様やお客様に接するとき、常に優雅であることを心掛けてますので。","source_cn":"或许是吧。但是对待子爵先生和尊贵的客人，我一直都很有风度。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xDD40FEA734845744","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"そうかもしれませんね。私は子爵様やお客様に接するとき、常に優雅であることを心掛けてますので。","female":"そうかもしれませんね。私は子爵様やお客様に接するとき、常に優雅であることを心掛けてますので。","variant_male_record_index":"149053","variant_female_record_index":"149054","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:32:1:2":{"text":"いつもそんな話し方なのか？","source_cn":"你一向说话都是这个风格吗？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x7D400CB454551E77","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_differs","male":"いつもそんな話し方なのか？","female":"いつもそんな話し方なの？","variant_male_record_index":"69598","variant_female_record_index":"69599","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:茶壶先生":{"text":"ポットの召使い","source":"茶壶先生","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:奇花侍者":{"text":"サイレンシアの召使い","source":"奇花侍者","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:满满":{"text":"ロンロン","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"メイメイ","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":34,"localized_text_count":33,"speaker_count":4}}